First Project
Group members: Alexander Lapsley, Kai Wei, Ifeoluwa Olusola
Modified Files: find.c, sleep.c, ls.c, uniq.c

Modifications:
ls: Modified ls to automatically hide hidden files unless -a is added to the end of the command, also modified it to distinguish directories with \
sleep: Implemented sleep command that pauses the system for a specified amount of time
uniq: Implemented uniq command to read input from a file and remove duplicate lines, supports -c, -d, and -i flags. Also supports commands in this format "cat filename | uniq"
find: Implemented find command that searches for files by name, supports -type, -inum, and -printi flags.

Ran using windows 11 and i7 14700 and gcc 11.
